est enemy head instantly in third person)\nSilent Aim - (Bullets redirect to target without visible aim movement)\nESP Players - (Shows all enemy positions distance and health through walls)\nTriggerbot - (Auto fires sniper when crosshair touches enemy)\nWallhack - (See all enemies through arena walls and structures)\nAuto Headshot - (Every sniper shot automatically lands on head)\nNo Scope Sway - (Removes all sniper scope sway completely)\nHitbox Expander - (Enlarges enemy hitboxes for easier flick shots)\nInfinite Ammo - (Never runs out of sniper or pistol rounds)\nNo Reload - (Skips reload animation on all weapons)\nRapid Fire - (Increases fire rate on sniper and pistol)\nSpeed Modifier - (Adjustable movement speed across the arena)\nFly - (Free flight above the labyrinth arena)\nNoclip - (Pass through all arena walls and geometry)\nKill All - (Eliminates all players on server instantly)\nGod Mode - (Full invincibility from all damage sources)\nKnife Aura - (One hit knife kill on all nearby players)\nTeleport To Player - (Instant teleport behind any enemy)\nAnti Spawn Kill - (Invincibility extended after each respawn)\nUnlock All Skins - (Access all 70 plus weapon skins instantly)\nInfinite Cash - (Unlimited currency for all purchases)\nAuto Roll Cases - (Opens all cases automatically for rare cosmetics)\nUnlock All Kill Effects - (Unlocks every kill effect cosmetic)\nAuto Trickshot - (Performs trickshot kills for bonus score)\nStreak Activator - (Activates all streaks immediately on demand)\nAuto Win - (Automatically finishes first on the scoreboard)\nFOV Changer - (Adjustable field of view for wider third person vision)\nAnti Camper ESP - (Highlights stationary players with special markers)","tags":["One Tap","One Tap Script"],"discord":"","keyLink":"","owner":{"_id":"6775a6c521958b1e79d7afa6","username":"AIMScripts","verified":false,"profilePicture":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/0f2d96d7e600b355c8f7382df2fabfbb1908ae68b52c62085f64efc3f10777ce.webp","original